#: src/features/analytics/Retention.tsx
msgid "Turn on the persistent id in the consent features, then call yuva.consent with persistent set to true."
msgstr "Zapnite trvalé ID vo funkciách súhlasu a potom zavolajte yuva.consent s persistent nastaveným na true."

#: src/features/analytics/Funnels.tsx
msgid "Two to eight goals, in the order visitors reach them within one visit."
